-      "en": "Balance at one step. A perfect pairing of two finite lists under a relation conserves count; under the one it is exactly equal count, and under the empty relation equal count gives none. Lists paired from what comes in (before, given) to what goes on (after, taken) have after + taken = before + given, and every four numbers with that equation are lengths of unit lists so paired under the one. Near-definitional. Counting a region's units (a region read as a test, a modelling choice), a pairing keeps the count on every region the relation does not cross, so on every region closed under it and its converse, closed one way not being enough; under a class decided by a test a pairing is exactly equal count in every class, and the class does work (equal count pairs under the one, not under sameness), so a pairing under continuation relative to such a class keeps the count in every class. The census of a step: units listed once before and after it, under a continuation fixing successors and predecessors, pair those before with those arising to those after with those ceasing, each pair a continuation or the same unit, and where the predecessors of the units after stand before and the successors of the units before stand after, arising and ceasing are beginning and ending. The listing and the test are supplied.",
-      "zh": "一步之平衡：一关系下两有限列表之完全配对守其数；在「一」之下恰是等长，在空关系下等长不给配对。自所入（先前、所给）至所续（其后、所取）配对之列表有 后 + 取 = 先 + 给，凡合此式之四数皆为「一」下如此配对的单位列表之长。近乎定义。计一域之单位（域读作一判别，此为建模之择），配对守其关系所不越之每一域之数，故守对关系及其逆皆封闭之每一域之数，单向封闭不足；在由一判别所定之类下，配对恰是每一类中等数，而类有其用（等长者在「一」下配对，在「静」下不配对），故相对于此类之续下之配对守每一类之数。一步之清点：一步前后各列一次之单位，在定后定前之续下，前者并所生者与后者并所亡者一一配对，每对或为续或为同一单位；后列诸单位之前者皆在前列、前列诸单位之后者皆在后列之处，所列之生与亡恰是生与亡。列表与判别皆为所给。",
+      "en": "Balance at one step. A perfect pairing of two finite lists under a relation conserves count; under the one it is exactly equal count, and under the empty relation equal count gives none. Lists paired from what comes in (before, given) to what goes on (after, taken) have after + taken = before + given, and every four numbers with that equation are lengths of unit lists so paired under the one. Near-definitional. Counting a region's units (a region read as a test, a modelling choice), a pairing keeps the count on every region the relation does not cross, so on every region closed under it and its converse, closed one way not being enough; under a class decided by a test a pairing is exactly equal count in every class, and the class does work (equal count pairs under the one, not under sameness), so a pairing under continuation relative to such a class keeps the count in every class. The census of a step: units listed once before and after it, under a continuation fixing successors and predecessors, pair those before with those arising to those after with those ceasing, each pair a continuation or the same unit, and where the predecessors of the units after stand before and the successors of the units before stand after, arising and ceasing are beginning and ending. Counted, the census needs no decision of identity: under a continuation fixing successors, the units listed once after a step with those a test marks as ceasing are at most the units before with those a test marks as arising, the tests asking only, as far as can be refuted, that a unit marked as ceasing has no successor after and that a unit after not marked as arising has a predecessor before; its mirror holds under a continuation fixing predecessors, and where both are fixed the two meet in the census's count, the tests read off its decision. Along a run, from some step on, the units after each step listed once, nothing splitting and every predecessor of a unit listed after a step listed before it, endings recurring among the listed units need beginnings recurring among the units listed after a step, the beginnings and endings decided by tests. Each is the corollary of a local form beside it that asks no split (no merge) only among the listed units. The listing and the test are supplied.",
+      "zh": "一步之平衡：一关系下两有限列表之完全配对守其数；在「一」之下恰是等长，在空关系下等长不给配对。自所入（先前、所给）至所续（其后、所取）配对之列表有 后 + 取 = 先 + 给，凡合此式之四数皆为「一」下如此配对的单位列表之长。近乎定义。计一域之单位（域读作一判别，此为建模之择），配对守其关系所不越之每一域之数，故守对关系及其逆皆封闭之每一域之数，单向封闭不足；在由一判别所定之类下，配对恰是每一类中等数，而类有其用（等长者在「一」下配对，在「静」下不配对），故相对于此类之续下之配对守每一类之数。一步之清点：一步前后各列一次之单位，在定后定前之续下，前者并所生者与后者并所亡者一一配对，每对或为续或为同一单位；后列诸单位之前者皆在前列、前列诸单位之后者皆在后列之处，所列之生与亡恰是生与亡。计之，清点不须同一之判定：在定后之续下，一步后各列一次之单位并判别所标为亡者，不过步前之单位并判别所标为生者；判别所问，于可驳之限内，唯标为亡者在后无后者、后列未标为生者在前有前者；定前之续下其镜像亦然；两者皆定之处，二者相会于清点之数，判别读自其判定。沿一程，自某步起，各步后之单位各列一次、无分裂、步后所列单位之前者皆列于其前，所列单位中亡屡则步后所列单位中生屡，生与亡由判别所定。每一律为其旁一局部之形之推论，后者只在所列单位之中要求无分裂（无合并）。列表与判别皆为所给。",
